    "about_fz": {
      "type": "media-with-content",
      "blocks": {
        "about_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>About Funny Shirtz</h2><p>We started Funny Shirtz because we got tired of wearing the same boring tees everyone else had. Based in Boise, Idaho, we design and print every shirt with one goal: make someone laugh.</p><p>From office humor to pop culture, we create wearable jokes that actually land. Every design is original, every shirt is printed on premium soft cotton, and every order is packed with care right here in the Treasure Valley.</p><p>Whether you're shopping for yourself or hunting for the perfect gift, you're in the right place. Life's too short for boring clothes.</p>",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "width": "fill",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "about_btn": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Shop Our Story",
            "link": "shopify://collections/all",
            "style_class": "button-primary",
            "width": "fit-content",
            "custom_width": 100,
            "width_mobile": "fit-content",
            "custom_width_mobile": 100
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "about_text",
        "about_btn"
      ],
